# Force these as binary (no line-ending conversion, no diffing as text).
# Without this, a contributor with core.autocrlf enabled can silently
# corrupt a committed binary — which is exactly what happened to
# android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar (CI failed with
# "Invalid or corrupt jarfile" until it was replaced).
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.zip binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
